  "problem": [
    "二、計算 EMI (20%)(5%, 5%, 5%, 5%)",
    "EMI = height^2(cm^2)%(weight(KG))",
    "Normal height: 50~250 cm (50<=height<=250).",
    "Normal weight: 20~300 KG (20<=weight<=300)",
    "e.g. 50 Kg, 158 cm",
    " EMI = (158^2)%(50) = 14",
    "規則 :",
    "(1) If height not in normal, then output \"Input Height Error\".",
    "(2) If weight not in normal, then output \"Input Weight Error\".",
    "(3) If 10<=EMI<=35, then output the EMI value",
    "(4) If EMI too high (>35), then output “EMI too high”",
    "(5) If EMI too low (<10), then output “EMI too low”",
    "(6) 最後根據 EMI 由大到小的順序將名字和 EMI 輸出",
    " (若該名字為 Input Height Error 或 Input Weight Error，則不參與最後 EMI 的排序和輸出)"
  ],
